        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana TSH40, Triple Swivel Hooks</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade of solid brass, this 4\" wall hook features 3 swiveling hook arms making it easier to hang more items when necessary. It can mounted to your wall or the inside of closet doors. Easy to install with the included mounting hardware. It has a 3-7/8\" length.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-TSH40-size.gif?v=1704354503\" width=\"491\" height=\"201\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana TSH40 Wall Hook Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana TSH40 Triple Swivel Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Base Plate Height: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Base Plate Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Projection: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/TSH40.pdf?v=1691095378\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana TSH40 Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
