                "title": "Triple Swivel Wall Hook, Deltana TSH40",
                "description": "Triple Swivel Hook Deltana TSH40 - Made of solid brass, this 4 inch wall hook features 3 swiveling hook arms making it easier to hang more items when necessary. It can mounted to your wall or the inside of closet doors. Easy to install with the included mounting hardware. It has a 3-7/8 inch length.\r\n",
